# The local updater test override points builds at a throwaway repository. The
# `*.local` rule above already covers it; it is named explicitly as well because
# "a published build must never be able to point at a test update host" is worth
# more than one line of defence, and a future rename of that glob must not
# silently expose this.
src-tauri/tauri.updatertest.conf.json5.local

